'''''Timmiella''''' is a genus of [[moss]]es in the family [[Timmiellaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Timmiella (De Not.) Limpr. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2671678 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=7 May 2025 |language=en}}</ref> The genus has an almost [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF" />

The genus was previously classified in the family [[Pottiaceae]] until molecular phylogenetic analysis was completed in 2014.<ref>{{cite journal |last1=Inoue |first1=Yuya |last2=Tsubota |first2=Hiromi |title=On the systematic position of the genus Timmiella (Dicranidae, Bryopsida) and its allied genera, with the description of a new family Timmiellaceae |journal=Phytotaxa |date=3 October 2014 |volume=181 |issue=3}}</ref>

